 "era.cockpit.cleaning": {
  "title": "Cockpit page: Schedule (sambarentals.com/payouts)",
  "audience": [
   "era",
   "system"
  ],
  "text": "The next 30 days for every villa: cleans, guest arrivals and departures, and tukang visits. Built from the booking calendar every hour. Each housekeeper gets her day on WhatsApp in the morning and her week on Monday.\n\n### Reading it\n\n• The strip of days at the top shows a week; the small number under a day is how much is on. Tap a day to jump to it.\n\n• The chips filter the list: Cleaning , Guests , Maintenance , or one housekeeper's name to see just her week.\n\n• Tap a villa's name to see everything at that villa, including when the current guest leaves.\n\n• Same day in orange means the next guest arrives the day this one leaves. That clean cannot slip.\n\n### Changing things\n\n• Tap a clean to give it to someone else, move it to another day, or mark it Done or Skipped. A moved clean is sent again on its new day.\n\n• Add a clean : pick the villa, the day, then who. The kind is guessed from the calendar and you can change it.\n\n• Cleaning days sets which weekdays each villa is cleaned. Rebuild from the calendar refreshes the plan after a booking changes; cleans already sent to someone are kept.\n\n### Handover checks\n\n• When a housekeeper finishes a turnover before a guest, a pre-arrival or a deep clean, Maya asks her for a set of photos: the sofa with its cover, the kitchen and inside the oven, the bathroom with soap in it, the bed, the pool, the consumables box. Maya looks at them.\n\n• The pill on that clean says what happened: Checked (fine, nothing to do), Needs a look (something is wrong and you were messaged), Not checked (she never sent photos). Tap the clean to see the photos and what was flagged.\n\n• You only hear about problems. A quiet day means every handover passed.\n\n### Standards and rounds\n\n• Tap a villa, then Villa standard : the minimum kit every Samba villa must have. Walk it once and tap Yes or Missing. Every Missing goes to Maintenance for the owner to approve.\n\n• Deep clean (D) happens every three months, and the day after any guest who stayed 21 nights or more leaves: walls, inside the oven, exterior windows, grout, pool cushions, the dispenser. It waits for an empty villa when one is coming.\n\n• Rounds ahead shows six months of inspections and deep cleans. Calendar feed puts the whole schedule in Google Calendar.\n\n• Tap a housekeeper's name to see her last 30 days: visits done on the day, and handovers passed, flagged, or never answered."
 },
