  "text": "Terms Privacy Refunds\n\n## Terms of service\n\nLast updated: 29 July 2026\n\nThese Terms of Service (“Terms”) govern your access to and use of the Samba Rentals\nwebsite and owner portal at sambarentals.com (the “Service”), operated by\nSamba Rentals (“we”, “us”, “our”). By creating an account or using the Service, you agree\nto these Terms. If you do not agree, do not use the Service.\n\n## 1. The Service\n\nSamba Rentals provides a software platform that lets villa owners and property managers\nlist their properties so they can be marketed to a network of rental booking agents, and\nview analytics about how those listings are viewed and shared. The Service is a software\nsubscription; we are not a party to any rental agreement, booking, or transaction between\nyou and any guest or agent.\n\n## 2. Accounts\n\nYou sign in using your Google account. You are responsible for maintaining the security\nof the account you use to access the Service and for all activity that occurs under it. You\nmust provide accurate information and promptly update it if it changes. You must be at least\n18 years old and able to enter into a binding contract.\n\n## 3. Listings and your content\n\n• You may submit property details, descriptions, photos, pricing, and related content\n(“Owner Content”). You represent that you own or have the right to publish all Owner Content\nand that it is accurate and not misleading.\n\n• Submitted listings are reviewed by us before publication. We may approve, decline, edit\nfor clarity, unpublish, or remove any listing at our discretion, including content we consider\ninaccurate, unlawful, or inappropriate.\n\n• You grant us a non-exclusive, worldwide licence to host, display, reproduce, and share\nyour Owner Content for the purpose of operating and promoting the Service and your listing.\n\n• You retain ownership of your Owner Content.\n\n## 4. Subscriptions, billing and pricing\n\n• A listing is published and kept live only while it has an active paid subscription. The\nfee is IDR 150,000 per listed property, per month . Because our merchant of\nrecord processes payments internationally, the charge is settled as US$9.50, billed in\nadvance and renewing automatically each month until cancelled.\n\n• Payments are processed by our reseller and merchant of record,\nCreem (operated by Armitage Labs OÜ). When you purchase a\nsubscription, your order is also subject to\nCreem’s Buyer Terms .\nWe do not store or process your card details.\n\n• You can cancel at any time from your owner portal or the Creem customer portal. See our\nRefund & cancellation policy .\n\n• Prices may change; we will give reasonable notice of any change before it applies to your\nnext billing period.\n\n## 5. Acceptable use\n\nYou agree not to use the Service to publish false, fraudulent, or unlawful listings; to\ninfringe others’ rights; to upload malicious code; to attempt to gain unauthorised access to\nthe Service or other accounts; or to interfere with the Service’s operation.\n\n## 6. Intellectual property\n\nThe Service, including its software, design, and branding, is owned by us and protected by\napplicable laws. These Terms do not grant you any right to our trademarks or other intellectual\nproperty except as needed to use the Service.\n\n## 7. Disclaimers\n\nThe Service is provided “as is” and “as available” without warranties of any kind, whether\nexpress or implied. We do not warrant that the Service will be uninterrupted or error-free, or\nthat listing your property will result in any bookings, enquiries, or revenue.\n\n## 8. Limitation of liability\n\nTo the maximum extent permitted by law, we will not be liable for any indirect, incidental,\nspecial, or consequential damages, or for loss of profits, revenue, data, or goodwill. Our total\nliability arising out of or relating to the Service will not exceed the amount you paid us in the\nthree months before the event giving rise to the claim.\n\n## 9. Termination\n\nYou may stop using the Service at any time by cancelling your subscriptions and deleting your\nproperties. We may suspend or terminate your access if you breach these Terms or to comply with\nthe law. On termination, your listings will be unpublished.\n\n## 10. Changes to these Terms\n\nWe may update these Terms from time to time. If we make material changes, we will update the\n“Last updated” date and, where appropriate, notify you. Continued use of the Service after changes\ntake effect constitutes acceptance.\n\n## 11. Governing law\n\nThese Terms are governed by the laws of the Republic of Indonesia, without regard to conflict\nof law principles. Disputes will be subject to the courts located in Indonesia, unless otherwise\nrequired by applicable consumer law.\n\n## 12. Contact\n\nQuestions about these Terms? Contact us at\nsupport@sambarentals.com .\n\nTerms of service · Privacy policy ·\nRefund & cancellation policy\n\nAgent portal\n\nOwner portal"
