  "text": "Log in\nList your villa\n\nFor Bali villa owners\n\n## One listing. 300+ rental agents.\n\nSamba is where Bali's rental agents find long-term villas for their clients.\nList once. Every agent sees your live availability and shares your villa directly with tenants.\n\nList your villa\nSee how it works\n\nFree to list · Five minutes to submit, live within a day · No commissions\n\nFounding offer\n\nThe first 25 villas list free with code FOUNDING25\n\nSamba's standard price is IDR 150,000/month per villa (billed as US$9.50), with no commissions and no booking fees. Founding villas skip it entirely.\n\n300+ active rental agents\n24/7 visibility for your villa\nDirect owner enquiries\n0% commission, ever\n\nHow it works\n\n## From listing to booked, in 3 simple steps\n\n1\n\nWe list your villa\n\nSubmit through the portal or over WhatsApp. We create the listing, sync your calendar with Airbnb and Hostex, and make the presentation look premium.\n\n2\n\nAgents see and share\n\n300+ rental agents get your live availability and share your villa page with their clients the same day.\n\n3\n\nYou respond directly\n\nAgents bring interested clients, and enquiries come straight to you. No middlemen, no delays.\n\nMeet Maya (AI)\n\n## Maya works the network for you\n\nA daily broadcast to every agent\n\nWhen your availability changes, Maya tells the whole agent network on WhatsApp the next morning. New listings get seen in their first week.\n\nOnboarding over WhatsApp\n\nSend Maya your villa details and photos in a normal chat. She prepares the listing, ready for you to review.\n\nYour Monday report\n\nEvery Monday, Maya sends your villa's week to your WhatsApp: agent views, client shares and enquiries at a glance.\n\nYour dashboard\n\n## Know exactly how your villa performs\n\nAgent views, client shares and enquiries at a glance. No guesswork about whether agents are actually showing your villa, and the full breakdown is always waiting in your owner dashboard.\n\nGet started\n\n## List your villa in under 5 minutes\n\nBoth paths take about five minutes. Both end with your villa in front of every rental agent on Samba.\n\nFASTEST\n\nList it yourself in the owner portal\n\nAlready on Airbnb or Booking.com? Paste the link and we copy everything over, photos included. Otherwise a short guided flow walks you through it, with photos straight from your phone.\n\nAirbnb\nBooking.com\n\nOpen the owner portal →\n\nList with Maya on WhatsApp\n\nSend Maya your villa details and photos in a normal WhatsApp chat. She prepares the listing for you, and it appears in your portal ready to review.\n\nStart the chat →\n\n≈ 5 minutes\n\nSubmit your villa\n\nPhotos, pricing and availability, through the portal or over WhatsApp.\n\nWe handle it\n\nWe set you up\n\nWe create your listing, sync your calendar with Airbnb and Hostex, and make it look premium.\n\nLive in 24 hours\n\nAgents start sharing\n\nYour villa appears in the agent portal with live availability. Agents share it with their clients immediately.\n\n24\nvillas live on Samba\n\n300+\nrental agents\n\n0%\ncommission, ever\n\nFAQ\n\n## Common questions\n\nWhat does it cost?\n\nNothing for the founding 25 villas. Use code FOUNDING25 when you list and it's free. Samba's standard price is IDR 150,000/month per villa (billed as US$9.50). There are no commissions or booking fees, ever. You keep what you earn.\n\nWho closes the deal?\n\nYou do. When an agent has an interested client, they contact you directly to arrange viewings and agree terms. Samba makes the introduction. We never middleman your deal.\n\nDoes my calendar stay in sync?\n\nYes. Samba syncs with Airbnb and Hostex, so agents always see current availability without you updating anything. When your availability changes, every agent knows.\n\nWill Samba compete with my agents?\n\nNever. Samba connects owners with agents. We don't go around them. Agents are the network, and every enquiry an agent brings goes straight to you.\n\nDo I still need Airbnb?\n\nKeep it. Samba covers the long-term market Airbnb doesn't serve well, and syncs with your existing calendar, so nothing double-books and every vacancy works both channels.\n\nCan I remove my listing later?\n\nAnytime. It's your villa and your listing. Unpublish it from the owner portal whenever you like, no questions asked.\n\n## Stop coordinating. Start renting.\n\nJoin the founding 25 and put your villa in front of every rental agent on Samba.\n\nList your villa\nChat on WhatsApp\n\nAre you a rental agent? Samba for agents →\n\nAgent portal ·\nFor agents ·\nSign in ·\nTerms of service ·\nPrivacy policy ·\nRefund policy ·\nsupport@sambarentals.com\n\n© 2026 Samba · Bali, Indonesia\n\nAgent portal\n\nOwner portal\n\n×\n\nList your villa\n\nSign in to list your villa and manage availability, photos and pricing. New here? Google sign-in creates your account.\n\n• One listing, 300+ rental agents. Every agent on Samba sees your live availability\n\n• Weekly reports on WhatsApp. Views, shares and client enquiries for your villa\n\nor\n\nContinue with WhatsApp\n\nSend my sign-in link\n\nThe first 25 villas list free with code FOUNDING25\nExplore the demo first →"
